ode. The content is one `versoCodeLine` token per source line. Each line's token\nrecords the docstring's indentation on the line after it as trailing whitespace, while indentation\npast that column is part of the code. A space written at each end of the content to escape a\nbacktick or a space becomes whitespace on the token before it.","docLink":"./Lean/DocString/Parser.html#Lean.Doc.Parser.codeFn","kind":"def","line":1154,"name":"Lean.Doc.Parser.codeFn","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/DocString/Parser.lean#L1154-L1223"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">partial def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/DocString/Parser.html#Lean.Doc.Parser.boldFn\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Doc</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">boldFn</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ctxt</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/DocString/Parser.html#Lean.Doc.Parser.InlineCtxt\">InlineCtxt</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Parser/Types.html#Lean.Parser.ParserFn\">Parser.ParserFn</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Parses bold: a matched pair of one or more `*`.","docLink":"./Lean/DocString/Parser.html#Lean.Doc.Parser.boldFn","kind":"opaque","line":1148,"name":"Lean.Doc.Parser.boldFn","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/DocString/Parser.lean#L1148-L1152"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">partial def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/DocString/Parser.html#Lean.Doc.Parser.emphFn\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Doc</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">emphFn</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span cla